<header id="top" class="hero"><div class="hero-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow"><i class="fas fa-sparkles"></i> Examination integrity operations</div><h1>Turn every incident into a <span>clear, accountable</span> decision.</h1><p class="hero-copy">BUK EIMS gives Bayero University Kano a calm, connected workspace for reporting, triage, case management, hearings, appeals, and institutional insight.</p><div class="hero-actions"><button id="hero-login" class="hero-button white"><i class="fas fa-arrow-right-to-bracket"></i> Enter staff workspace</button><a class="outline-button" href="#features" data-scroll="#features"><i class="fas fa-compass"></i> Explore capabilities</a></div><div class="hero-meta"><div class="meta-item"><i class="fas fa-circle-check"></i> Guided reporting</div><div class="meta-item"><i class="fas fa-timeline"></i> Case timelines</div><div class="meta-item"><i class="fas fa-chart-line"></i> Live analytics</div></div></div><div class="hero-panel"><div class="panel-top"><span class="panel-label"><i class="fas fa-shield-halved"></i> BUK integrity workspace</span><span class="live-dot"><span class="pulse-indicator"></span> 2025/2026 Session Active</span></div><div class="mini-screen"><div class="mini-head"><strong>Operations Dashboard</strong><div class="mini-avatar">BUK</div></div><div class="mini-cards"><div class="mini-card green-card"><strong>24</strong><small><i class="fas fa-arrow-trend-up"></i> Open cases</small></div><div class="mini-card amber-card"><strong>08</strong><small><i class="fas fa-gavel"></i> Hearings</small></div><div class="mini-card blue-card"><strong>96%</strong><small><i class="fas fa-check-double"></i> Resolved</small></div></div><div class="mini-chart-card"><div class="mini-chart-head"><span><i class="fas fa-chart-line" style="color:var(--buk-green)"></i> Incident Velocity (Exam Cycle)</span><span class="mini-chart-badge">+18% Timely Triage</span></div><svg class="chart-svg" viewBox="0 0 300 60" preserveAspectRatio="none"><defs><linearGradient id="chartGrad" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="#10b981" stop-opacity="0.32"/><stop offset="100%" stop-color="#0284c7" stop-opacity="0.01"/></linearGradient></defs><path d="M0,50 Q40,42 80,45 T160,25 T240,18 T300,8 L300,60 L0,60 Z" fill="url(#chartGrad)"/><path d="M0,50 Q40,42 80,45 T160,25 T240,18 T300,8" fill="none" stroke="#059669" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="80" cy="45" r="3.5" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#059669" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="160" cy="25" r="3.5" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#059669" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="240" cy="18" r="3.5" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#0284c7" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="300" cy="8" r="4.5" fill="#0284c7" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="2"/></svg></div><div class="mini-list"><div class="mini-row"><div class="mini-icon blue-icon"><i class="fas fa-file-circle-exclamation"></i></div><div><strong>New incident report</strong><small>Awaiting examination officer triage</small></div><span class="pill blue-pill"><i class="fas fa-clock"></i> Review</span></div><div class="mini-row"><div class="mini-icon amber-icon"><i class="fas fa-calendar-days"></i></div><div><strong>Committee hearing</strong><small>Today · 10:00 AM · Senate Chamber</small></div><span class="pill amber-pill"><i class="fas fa-gavel"></i> Hearing</span></div><div class="mini-row"><div class="mini-icon green-icon"><i class="fas fa-clipboard-check"></i></div><div><strong>Decision recorded</strong><small>Timeline and evidence are ratifying</small></div><span class="pill green-pill"><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Closed</span></div></div></div></div></div></header>
